<p>MEELO'N KA FAASLA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>HAR TARHA KI JAFA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>1. ALLAH JJH. JAANE KAISI, TOOTI NAYI MUSIBAT.</p>

<p>NAMOOS BERIDA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>2. HAR EK QADAM QAYAMAT, HAR EK QADAM PE GIRNA.</p>

<p>DURRO'N KI INTEHA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>3. WO NANGE PAOU'N CHALNA, WO AABILO'N KA PHATNA.</p>

<p>AUR REGE KARBALA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>4. PAIRO'N MEIN BEDIYA'N HAI, LANGAR BANDHI KAMAR MEIN.</p>

<p>JAKDA HUA GALA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>5. WO DHOOP KI TAMAZAT, AUR PYAAS KI WO SHIDDAT.</p>

<p>SAR PAR NA AASRA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>
6. DIL PAR HAI DAAGH ITNE, KISKO BATAYE AAQIR.</p>

<p>GHUM KI NA KUCH DAWA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>7. ASNAA E RAAH E KUFA, QANJAR CHALE HAI DIL PAR.</p>

<p>HAR SAQT MARHALA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p>8. CHAALEES(40) SAAL HAR PAL, ROYA <b>SOHAIL</b> ISNE.</p>

<p>ASHKO'N KA SILSILA HAI, BEEMAR E KARBALA HAI.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RAZA ALI SOHAIL SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
</p>